<title>USA: Converse Q1 EPS $0.71 vs loss $0.20.</title>
<headline>Converse Q1 EPS $0.71 vs loss $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH READING, Mass. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.71     loss	 $0.20</p>
<p> Net profit		12,680     loss	 3,260</p>
<p> Revs		     135,969		   86,551</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,862		   16,692</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:Quarters ended March 29, 1997, and March 30, 1996.</p>
<p>The 1997 quarter includes an after-tax gain of $8 million, or $0.45 a share, resulting from the settlement of litigation.</p>
<p>Without that gain, earnings would have been $4.7 million, or $0.26 per share.</p>
</text>
